{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Destinations\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Destinations\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom"},{"title":"Conforming Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformingTypes"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/destination"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Destinations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/ConsoleDestination","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InvalidCapacity"],"anchor":"Destinations","generated":true}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Destination","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Protocol","symbolKind":"protocol","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"externalID":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Destination"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Destination.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Destination.swift#L27"}},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a delivery sends events: a plain sink that records the batches it receives."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/accepting(_:)","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/droppingCallSite()","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/enriched(by:)","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/receive(_:)","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/redactingSensitiveValues()"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deliver(to:batchBufferLimit:)"},{"type":"text","text":" gives each destination its batches in the order the events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"were tracked, one at a time: the next batch comes once "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/receive(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns. Batches that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrive meanwhile wait in a buffer of the destination’s own, which drops its oldest batch when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"full, so a destination that falls behind doesn’t hold up the others."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The delivery reports each batch dropped. Once the destination has caught up, it gets the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped batch’s records that a store keeps, read back from the store, after the newer batches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it received meanwhile; those kept in memory only are lost."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/receive(_:)"},{"text":" should return as soon as the batch is somewhere it won’t be lost, and honour","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancellation: a delivery waits for it before it completes, and cancels it when the delivery is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancelled. Until it returns, this destination’s later batches wait in its buffer. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination handles its own errors (a failed upload, say); the delivery has none to receive.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a tracker keeps its records in a store, returning from "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/receive(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is what tells the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store a batch arrived: once every destination has returned for it, uncancelled, the store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forgets those records. A destination that buffers or retries should return only once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch is somewhere it won’t be lost; a record whose "},{"code":"EventRecord.isRedelivered","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is set may"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have reached it in an earlier run."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What a destination receives is narrowed by modifiers rather than by code of its own:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/accepting(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for the consent categories it serves, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/redactingSensitiveValues()"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/droppingCallSite()"},{"type":"text","text":". A destination given none receives every record as tracked."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination/init(capacity:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"capacity","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations15InvalidCapacityV","text":"InvalidCapacity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"init(capacity:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that keeps the newest "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"type":"text","text":" records it receives."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/init(capacity:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/init(capacity:)","type":"topic"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Destination/droppingCallSite()":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This destination, receiving each record without its call site: "},{"code":"EventRecord.sourceLocation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/droppingCallSite()","title":"droppingCallSite()","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/destination\/droppingcallsite()","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"droppingCallSite","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"}